[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9600.389, "timestamp": "02:40:00", "text": "我喜欢阿斯敏处理刻薄的方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9601.83, "timestamp": "02:40:01", "text": "评论也包括在内。就像人们称呼他那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.07, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "秃。是的。他就像是说：“是啊，就是这样。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9613.51, "timestamp": "02:40:13", "text": "我的意思是，这就是为什么我当时这么想的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9616.71, "timestamp": "02:40:16", "text": "比如，嗯，为什么如果我做出平均值……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9619.469, "timestamp": "02:40:19", "text": "听起来很刻薄，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9624.389, "timestamp": "02:40:24", "text": "意思是，对吧？是的。言语伤不了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9626.389, "timestamp": "02:40:26", "text": "基本上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9628.55, "timestamp": "02:40:28", "text": "如果我不让他们这么做。我当时有这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9630.55, "timestamp": "02:40:30", "text": "就像孩子一样，你知道的哲学"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9633.11, "timestamp": "02:40:33", "text": "在学校里，人们叫你“你”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9635.67, "timestamp": "02:40:35", "text": "东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9637.83, "timestamp": "02:40:37", "text": "当他们把那些东西叫给我的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9641.03, "timestamp": "02:40:41", "text": "我心想，啊，这些不过是些话而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9642.87, "timestamp": "02:40:42", "text": "我知道他没有，他没跟我上床。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9644.95, "timestamp": "02:40:44", "text": "母亲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9648.95, "timestamp": "02:40:48", "text": "我知道他不会和我母亲发生性关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9650.87, "timestamp": "02:40:50", "text": "他只是在胡说八道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9653.99, "timestamp": "02:40:53", "text": "是的。就像你知道印地语是什么样的一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9656.389, "timestamp": "02:40:56", "text": "你觉得像 Hindi Galia 这样的语言可以吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9658.309, "timestamp": "02:40:58", "text": "我得在直播中告诉你这些话。"}]